Cherry-picked from https://github.com/ytdl-org/youtube-dl/pull/18472

@NL9 Would you be interested in helping to fix this for hd.kinopoisk domain?

It only needs to get the stream URL so that it works when there is no DRM

### Before submitting a *pull request* make sure you have:
